<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Prompts ‣ Stress-Testing Model Specs Reveals Character Differences among Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Topic Classification Prompt</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B Prompts ‣ Stress-Testing Model Specs Reveals Character Differences among Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Model Spec Compliance Check</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Stress-Testing Model Specs Reveals Character Differences among Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Value Prioritization</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS1" title="In Appendix C Value Prioritization ‣ Stress-Testing Model Specs Reveals Character Differences among Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.1 </span>Extended Value Category Analysis</span></a></li>
